Package: outguess
Version: 0.4
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Alienkrishn [Anon4You]
Depends: git, autoconf, automake, libtool, make, clang, gcc, libjpeg-turbo
Section: crypto
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/resurrecting-open-source-projects/outguess
Description: Universal steganographic tool for inserting hidden data into images
 outguess lets you hide information inside the redundant bits of data files,
 most commonly images (JPEG). It employs a robust data-hiding system that
 survives recompression and other transformations.
